Changes:
 libpng1.6 (1.6.39-2+deb12u6) bookworm-security; urgency=medium
 .
   * Non-maintainer upload by the LTS Team.
   * Fix CVE-2026-46675: use-after-free of zlib input in png_read_end()
     after incomplete zTXt, iTXt or iCCP decompression.
